      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "Prompt:\nIf the retrieved context doesn't adequately answer the question, respond with:\n\"INSUFFICIENT_CONTEXT: [explain what additional information is needed]\"\n\nContext: [chunks about Python syntax]\n\nQuestion: What is Python's garbage collection algorithm?\n\n---\n\nResponse:\nINSUFFICIENT_CONTEXT: The provided context discusses Python syntax and basic language \nfeatures, but doesn't explain garbage collection mechanisms. I would need documentation \ncovering Python's reference counting, generational garbage collection, or memory management."
        ]
      ]
