        [
          "python",
          "Prompt:\nSynthesize information from the provided documents to answer the question. When combining \ninformation from multiple documents, clearly indicate which document each fact comes from.\n\nDocument 1 (Technical Spec): \"The API uses REST architecture and accepts JSON payloads\"\nDocument 2 (User Guide): \"Call the /users endpoint to retrieve user information\"\nDocument 3 (Security Doc): \"All API calls must include a Bearer token for authentication\"\n\nQuestion: How do I call the API?\n\n---\n\nResponse:\nTo call the API [Document 1], you make REST requests with JSON payloads to specific endpoints \nsuch as /users to retrieve user information [Document 2]. All requests must include a Bearer \ntoken for authentication [Document 3]. For example:\n\nGET /users\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN"
        ]
